            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was wird die Konsole anzeigen, wenn wir den Code ausführen?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"average_grade = \" /><text value=\"&quot;B&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"average_grade = \" /><text value=\"&quot;A-&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"subject = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Programming&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(average_grade)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"A-\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>A-</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Programmierung</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>B</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>A-</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>average_grade</code> wird zweimal ein Wert zugewiesen. Welchen Wert verwendet <code>print(average_grade)</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"average_grade = \" /><text value=\"&quot;B&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"average_grade = \" /><text value=\"&quot;A-&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"subject = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Programming&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(average_grade)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"A-\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Den zuletzt zugewiesenen Wert <code>A-</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Den zuerst zugewiesenen Wert <code>B</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Den Wert <code>Programming</code> aus <code>subject</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Den zuletzt zugewiesenen Wert <code>A-</code>.</p></body></html>"
