            "id": 76344,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche dieser Optionen gibt <code>is_monday</code> den Wert <code>False</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>is_monday = not True</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>is_monday = \"True\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>is_monday = \"not True\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>is_monday = not True</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche Zeile verwendet <code>not</code>, um <code>is_monday</code> den speziellen Wert <code>False</code> zu geben?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>is_monday = not True</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>is_monday = True</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>is_monday = \"not True\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>is_monday = not True</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
